{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":1814905,"ns":0,"title":"Balancing lake","extract":"A balancing lake (also flood basin) is a term used in the UK to describe a retention basin used to control flooding by temporarily storing flood waters.   The term balancing pond is also used, though typically for smaller storage facilities for streams and brooks.","description":"Element of flood management system","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}